 dataclass teleoperateconfig 
     
    teleop  teleoperatorconfig
    robot  robotconfig
     
    fps  int   60
    teleop time s  float none
     
    display data  bool display mode  str    rerun 
     
     
    display ip  str none
     
    display port  int none
     
    display compressed images  bool teleop loop 
    teleop  teleoperator 
    robot  robot 
    fps  int 
    teleop action processor  robotprocessorpipeline tuple robotaction  robotobservation   robotaction  
    robot action processor  robotprocessorpipeline tuple robotaction  robotobservation   robotaction  
    robot observation processor  robotprocessorpipeline robotobservation  robotobservation  
    display data  bool display mode  str    rerun  
    duration  float none 
    display compressed images  bool display len   max len key key robot action features 
    start   time perf counter loop start   time perf counter  

         
         
         
         
        obs   robot observation robot name     unitree g1  
            teleop send feedback obs 

         
        raw action   teleop action  

         
        teleop action   teleop action processor  raw action  obs  

         
        robot action send   robot action processor  teleop action  obs  

         
            robot send action robot action send display data 
             
            obs transition   robot observation processor obs 

            log visualization data 
                display mode 
                observation obs transition 
                action teleop action 
                compress images display compressed images 
             

            print  \n     -     display len   10  
            print f   name    display len       norm   7 motor  value robot action send items   
                print f  motor   display len      value  7 2f   
            move cursor up len robot action send    3 

        dt s   time perf counter   - loop start
        precise sleep max 1   fps - dt s  0 0  
        loop s   time perf counter   - loop start
        print f teleop loop time   loop s   1e3  2f ms   1   loop s  0f  hz   
        move cursor up 1 duration time perf counter   - start    duration parser wrap teleoperate cfg  teleoperateconfig  
    init logging  
    logging info pformat asdict cfg cfg display data 
        init visualization 
            cfg display mode  session name  teleoperation   ip cfg display ip  port cfg display port
         
    display compressed images cfg display data cfg display ip cfg display port cfg display compressed images
     

    teleop   make teleoperator config cfg teleop 
    robot   make robot config cfg robot 
    teleop action processor  robot action processor  robot observation processor   make default processors  

    teleop connect  
    robot connect teleop loop 
            teleop teleop 
            robot robot 
            fps cfg fps 
            display data cfg display data 
            display mode cfg display mode 
            duration cfg teleop time s 
            teleop action processor teleop action processor 
            robot action processor robot action processor 
            robot observation processor robot observation processor 
            display compressed images display compressed images keyboardinterrupt cfg display data 
            shutdown visualization cfg display mode 
        teleop disconnect  
        robot disconnect main   
    register third party plugins  
    teleoperate name         main    
    main  
